RXPGuides.RegisterGuide([[
#version 1
#tbc
#classic
#include QuestDB
#group RestedXP TBC Preparation
#name !How to Use This Guide
#hidewindow
#internal
step
#tip
#completewith profession1
+You can go back and forth between the guides as needed, however |cRXP_WARN_it is recommended to complete the "Solo Pre-req" guide first|r as many of the quests in group and dungeon Pre-Requisites guides |cRXP_WARN_require quests from the solo section to be done first|r
+Consider leveling your professions before starting, all gathering professions, Cooking, Tailoring and Enchanting offers 1 extra free quest each. Engineers get access to teleporters that can speed up the turn in process.
step
+Welcome to the RXP Burning Crusade Anniversary preparation guide!
+Feel free to use "Total XP prepared" guide to check on your progress and have a look at your best available quests for the Quest Log guide.
+To start working on your quest prep |cRXP_WARN_select a guide from the Quest Pre-Requisites section first|r. It's divided into quests that can be done solo, in a group or in a dungeon
