RXPGuides.RegisterGuide([[
#version 1
#tbc
#classic
#include QuestDB
#group RestedXP TBC Preparation
#subgroup Preparation guide
#chapter
#title Reputations
#name Reputations
step
#sticky
>>This guide serves as a reminder for which reputations are worth grinding. Feel free to click through the steps without completing them, |cRXP_WARN_they don't have to be done in order|r
+Click here to hide this message
step << Alliance
.isQuestAvailable 7172
.reputation 730,exalted,999 >> Earn reputation with the Stormpike Guard until you reach exalted and then 999 reputation into exalted. |cRXP_WARN_Each reputation threshold will give you a free quest turn in so it's still worth doing even if you don't reach exalted|r
>>You can earn reputation by participating in the Alterac Valley battleground and turning in the |T133308:0|t[|cRXP_FRIENDLY_Alterac Valley Marks of Honor|r] you get from it
step << Horde
.isQuestAvailable 7167
.reputation 729,exalted,999 >> Earn reputation with the Frostwolf Clan until you reach exalted and then 999 reputation into exalted. |cRXP_WARN_Each reputation threshold will give you a free quest turn in so it's still worth doing even if you don't reach exalted|r
>>You can earn reputation by participating in the Alterac Valley battleground and turning in the |T133308:0|t[|cRXP_FRIENDLY_Alterac Valley Marks of Honor|r] you get from it
step
.reputation 576,exalted >> Reaching friendly with Timbermaw Hold will unlock 3 free quests for you worth a total of 24750xp
>> If you are willing to spend the time to grind to exalted you will unlock another free quest worth 14300xp
>>To grind this reputation kill Deadwood Furlbogs in northern Felwood and turn in |T132926:0|t[|cRXP_LOOT_Deadwood Headdress Feathers|r] you loot at |cRXP_FRIENDLY_Nafien|r next to Felwood side Timbermaw Hold entrance
>>Grinding Timbermaw reputation gets significantly easier on pre-patch << !tbc
.skill tailoring,1,1
step
.reputation 576,exalted >> Reaching friendly with Timbermaw Hold will unlock 4 free quests for you worth a total of 32900xp
>> If you are willing to spend the time to grind to exalted you will unlock another free quest worth 14300xp
>>To grind this reputation kill Deadwood Furlbogs in northern Felwood and turn in |T132926:0|t[|cRXP_LOOT_Deadwood Headdress Feathers|r] you loot at |cRXP_FRIENDLY_Nafien|r next to Felwood side Timbermaw Hold entrance
>>Grinding Timbermaw reputation gets significantly easier on pre-patch << !tbc
.skill tailoring,<1,1
step
#tip
#completewith adrep
+Up to 5999/6000 reputation into friendly you can farm regular mobs in the Plaguelands for reputation. After that start farming Stratholme or Scholomance and looting |T133445:0|t|cRXP_LOOT_Scourgestones|r
>>Once you hit revered the only way to get reputation aside from quests is to kill dungeon bossess and hand in Scourgestones. Naxxramas also gives a good amount of reputation.
step
#label adrep
.reputation 529,friendly >> Reaching |cRXP_WARN_friendly|r with the Argent Dawn unlocks multiple quests worth A LOT of XP so |cRXP_WARN_do not skip on this!|r
.reputation 529,exalted >> Reaching exalted with the Argent Dawn and collecting 25 |T133441:0|t[|cRXP_FRIENDLY_Argent Dawn Valor Tokens|r] you will unlock a free quest worth 11.900xp
>>Reaching revered with the Argent Dawn and collecting 10 |T133441:0|t[|cRXP_FRIENDLY_Argent Dawn Valor Tokens|r] unlocks a free quest worth 9550xp
>>You will also need one |T133441:0|t[|cRXP_FRIENDLY_Argent Dawn Valor Token|r] for "They Call Me "The Rooster"" quest worth 4750xp, it requires friendly reputation to turn in
.collect 12844,1,9141,1
.collect 12844,10,5513,1
.collect 12844,25,5517,1
.collectmultiple 12844 
.disablecheckbox
step
.reputation 910,exalted >> Reach as high a reputation standing as possible with |cRXP_FRIENDLY_The Brood of Nozdormu|r. Each threshold is a free quest turn in at Anachronos in front of the Caverns of Time
>>By far the best source of this reputation comes from raiding the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ40) and then turning in the |T135723:0|t[Qiraji Lord's Insignia] that drop from bosses there
>>Don't turn any |T135723:0|t[Qiraji Lord's Insignias] until you reach 2999/3000 into neutral reputation as up to that threshold you still get a significant amount of reputation from AQ40 trash mobs
step
#tip
#completewith ccEnd
+If you don't have enough AQ20 lockouts to reach the next desired reputation threshold you can turn in Encrypted Twilight Text to |cRXP_FRIENDLY_Bor Wildmane|r in Cenarion Hold, you will lose an extra 9550xp, but will get easier access to the Cenarion Circle turn ins
step
#label ccEnd
.reputation 609,exalted >> Cenarion Circle will unlock the option to turn in the AQ 20 ring/cloak/weapon quests and also the Abyssal Crests/Signets/Scepters, try to aim for at least Revered
>>You can do it by raiding AQ20 and completing quests. |cRXP_WARN_Field duty and related quests are a solid and repetable source of reputation|r
>>|cRXP_WARN_Keep in mind you don't want to do quests you need for the turn in guide or turn in Encrypted Twilight Text as you need them for XP later|r
step
.reputation 270,exalted >>Reach as high reputation as possible with the |cRXP_FRIENDLY_Zandalar Tribe|r. Each threshold unlocks 2 quests, one free turn in (the necklace quest) and one ZG tier piece quest that requires a token from the raid
>>You can gain reputation by killing ZG bosses and trash and well as turning in ZG coins or destroying Bijous at the island. |cRXP_WARN_Do not turn in the Bijou quest|r
step << Alliance
.reputation 72,honored >> Reaching honored with |cRXP_FRIENDLY_Stormwind|r will unlock a quest chain worth 2 quests (|cRXP_PICK_Flint Shadowmore|r)
>>If you're not honored by the time you finish preparing your character's quest log, the best way to farm reputation is by going into |cRXP_FRIENDLY_Alterac Valley|r, looting players you kill and then turning in scraps/bloods/flesh at your base
.isQuestAvailable 6182
step
+You have completed this section of the guide. |cRXP_WARN_Select another one to continue|r
]])
